    <string name="info_text">The presented control unit is based on an ESP32 microprocessor and is designed to manage a compact wastewater treatment system. The 24 V AC input is stabilized to 3.3 V DC using an LM2596 DC/DC converter. Communication is handled via a USB interface (FT232) and WiFi (WebSocket server). Timekeeping is managed by an MCP79410 RTC module with a CR2032 backup battery. Operational data is recorded on an integrated SD card. The unit provides four digital inputs and four digital outputs. Temperature measurement is performed with a DS18B20 sensor, and water level monitoring is achieved using an EARU pressure sensor. The circuit diagram and PCB layout are available via the web interface:  </string>
